#: main.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
"kinstance name.\n"
"This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
"KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
"The final D-Bus object path is /KBookmarkManager/<dbusObjectName>"
msgstr "Jedinstveni naziv koji predstavlja ovu zbirku oznaka, obično naziv instance.\nZa oznake Konquerora to bi trebalo biti „konqueror”, za oznake KFileDialoga „kfile” itd.\nZavršna putanja objekta D-Bus glasi /KBookmarkManager/<dbusObjectName>"

